{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.kiriko.first",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "会客室里的绷带",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.kiriko.first",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.kiriko.first",
    "idolId": "kiriko",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "当然记得。你愿意来，我很高兴。以后请多关照。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "好、好的……！",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "话说回来，你刚才是在缠绷带……手臂受伤了吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "……不，那个……只是稍微撞了一下。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊……保险起见，要不要让医生看看？",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "不、不用了，不是什么大伤……真的，没关系……！",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……是吗。那如果有变化，一定要告诉我。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "好、好的……！……那个……谢、谢谢你……！",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，不用这么紧张。不过……你绷带卷得真好。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "是的……！那个……这样缠着，会安心一点。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "见制作人先生之前……我想让自己别那么紧张……",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……？缠绷带能让人不紧张吗。）",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "……プ、プロデューサーさん。接下来……请多指教……！",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。一起加油吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（绷带缠得那么认真……她说的「安心」，大概不是随口说的。）"
      },
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（今天起就要带偶像了。听说她已经在会客室等着——）",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……门开了一条缝。）",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "……嗯、嗯……",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "……好了……！……呵呵，绷带，这次卷得比平时好一点……♪",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "……啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……啊，不小心看入神了。）抱歉，没敲门就进来了。我是——",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "プ、プロデューサー……さん……",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "幽谷霧子小姐，对吧？从试镜那天之后就没见了。",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "……！你、你还记得我的名字呢……",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
